# headwear/cloth/hood: the culture Hood (OUTER, P2b wave 2; first drawn by the slice): a soft round hood over the head and hair,
# a lit folded rim over the brow, the hood's shadowed inside framing the face, a seam over the crown, a cowl on the shoulders.
# Hair mask: 18 px wide over the head (the hair's 14-18 px box), so no lock of a capped style shows outside it; the fringe
# shows under the rim; long lengths, braids and tails below the cowl still show (STYLE_P2 21). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
